### Get tokens: Kubernetes
POST http://localhost:38087/realms/sharetrip/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=sharetrip-api&client_secret={{CLIENT_SECRET}}&username={{USER_NAME}}&password={{USER_PASSWORD}}&grant_type=password

### Get tokens: Docker Compose

# curl --request POST
#  --url http://localhost:8087/realms/sharetrip/protocol/openid-connect/token
#  --header 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded'
#  --data 'client_id=sharetrip-api'
#  --data 'client_secret=ТВОЙ_CLIENT_SECRET'
#  --data 'username=ТВОЙ_USERNAME'
#  --data 'password=ТВОЙ_PASSWORD'
#  --data 'grant_type=password'
POST http://localhost:8087/realms/sharetrip/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=sharetrip-api&client_secret={{CLIENT_SECRET}}&username={{USER_NAME}}&password={{USER_PASSWORD}}&grant_type=password

